    <custom_item>
      type        : REGISTRY_SETTING
      description : "1.122 WN22-CC-000290"
      info        : "Windows Server 2022 System event log size must be configured to 32768 KB or greater.

GROUP ID: V-254360
RULE ID: SV-254360r958752

Inadequate log size will cause the log to fill up quickly. This may prevent audit events from being recorded properly and require frequent attention by administrative personnel."
      solution    : 'Configure the policy value for

Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Windows Components >> Event Log Service >> System >> Specify the maximum log file size (KB) to \'Enabled\' with a \'Maximum Log Size (KB)\' of \'32768\' or greater```.'
      reference   : "800-53|AU-4,800-53r5|AU-4,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-001849,CSF|PR.DS-4,CSF|PR.PT-1,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(b),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.6,ITSG-33|AU-4,LEVEL|2A,NESA|T3.3.1,NESA|T3.6.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-254360r958752_rule,STIG-ID|WN22-CC-000290,Vuln-ID|V-254360"
