      type         : AUDIT_USER_TIMESTAMPS
      description  : "1.19 WN22-00-000190"
      info         : "Windows Server 2022 outdated or unused accounts must be removed or disabled.

GROUP ID: V-254256
RULE ID: SV-254256r1051088

Outdated or unused accounts provide penetration points that may go undetected. Inactive accounts must be deleted if no longer necessary or, if still required, disabled until needed.

NOTE: Nessus has provided the target output to assist in reviewing the benchmark to ensure target compliance."
      solution     : "Regularly review accounts to determine if they are still active. Remove or disable accounts that have not been used in the last 35 days."
      reference    : "800-171|3.5.5,800-171|3.5.6,800-171r3|03.05.05,800-53|IA-4e.,800-53r5|AC-2(3),CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000795,CCI|CCI-003627,CN-L3|7.1.2.7(b),CSF|PR.AC-1,CSF2.0|PR.AA-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(i),HIPAA|164.312(d),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.16,ITSG-33|IA-4e.,LEVEL|2M,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|8.1.4,PCI-DSSv4.0|8.2.6,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-254256r1051088_rule,STIG-ID|WN22-00-000190,SWIFT-CSCv1|5,Vuln-ID|V-254256"
