          type        : REGISTRY_SETTING
          description : "1.193 WN22-MS-000030"
          info        : "Windows Server 2022 local users on domain-joined member servers must not be enumerated.

GROUP ID: V-254430
RULE ID: SV-254430r958478

The username is one part of logon credentials that could be used to gain access to a system. Preventing the enumeration of users limits this information to authorized personnel."
          solution    : 'Configure the policy value for

Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> System >> Logon >> Enumerate local users on domain-joined computers to \'Disabled\''
          reference   : "800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-171r3|03.04.06,800-171r3|03.04.06a.,800-53|CM-7,800-53|CM-7a.,800-53r5|CM-7a.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000381,CN-L3|7.1.3.5(c),CN-L3|8.1.4.4(a),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-7,ITSG-33|CM-7a.,LEVEL|2A,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.1,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|2.2.3,QCSC-v1|3.2,Rule-ID|SV-254430r958478_rule,STIG-ID|WN22-MS-000030,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-254430"
